# hai_pet_parity (2026-11-23): the JavaScript port (docs/pet.js) and the C op (ops/hai_pet.c) run the SAME commands and must give the SAME words, the same exit codes and byte-identical ledgers.
# The expected text below was recorded once from the C op (whose tick arithmetic case hai_pet checks against the house needs op) and is now literal: a mutant in EITHER implementation turns a row red.
# Needs node. Same ledger replayed by the other implementation must give the same status. NOT covered: the browser page (none yet). DEBT: absolute repo paths.
